#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Assuming <xref linkend=\"cython\"/> and <xref linkend=\"pytest\"/> are "
"installed, but the other optional dependencies are not, the installation can"
" be tested with the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Supondo que <xref linkend=\"cython\"/> e <xref linkend=\"pytest\"/> estejam "
"instalados, mas as outras dependências opcionais não estejam, a instalação "
